<h2>Asobi Review 0.2 (build 475)</h2>
<p><b>The progress bar knows when to leave.</b></p>
<ul>
<li><b>Fixed: the header progress bar stayed at 100% after the work finished.</b> A late progress update could land after the run had cleared it and pin it there for good. It now holds at 100% for a couple of seconds so you see it complete, then fades out.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
